---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Pair with Yorozu" description="Open this pairing code in Yorozu on your iPhone or iPad." mainClass="legal">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
    <script is:inline src="/pair.js" defer></script>
  </Fragment>
  <h1>Pair with your Mac</h1>
  <p>This is a Yorozu pairing code. Get Yorozu on this iPhone or iPad, then scan the code on your Mac again. With Yorozu installed, the camera opens it in the app.</p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="/iphone">Get Yorozu for iPhone</a>
    <a class="button ghost" id="open-in-app" href="/iphone" hidden>Open in Yorozu</a>
  </p>
  <p>The code stays on this device: it is in the part of the link your browser never sends to us. Keep it private; it works once and expires.</p>
</Base>
